\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
640\'96768px: the button group appears, defaulting to table.\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Below 640px: the same button group defaults to list. The option never disappears; someone who came to compare can still switch to table, they just have to do so.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
